# 🔄 DEX Arbitrage Bot - Complete Guide

## What is DEX Spot-Futures Arbitrage?

**DEX Arbitrage Bot** automatically profits from price differences between **spot markets** (Uniswap) and **futures markets** (Hyperliquid) - all on decentralized exchanges.

