## 💰 Fee Structure

### Uniswap V3 (Spot)
- Trading Fee: 0.05% - 0.3% (depends on pool)
- Gas Fee: ~$1-3 per trade (Arbitrum)

### Hyperliquid (Futures)
- Maker Fee: 0.02%
- Taker Fee: 0.05%
- Funding Payment: Varies (can be positive or negative)

### Total Cost per Round Trip
- Open position: ~$5-10 in fees
- Close position: ~$5-10 in fees
- Total: ~$10-20

**Minimum profitable basis: 0.5%** (to cover fees)

