## 🔧 Troubleshooting

### "No opportunities found"
- Funding rates too low (< 0.5%)
- Basis spread too tight (< 1%)
- Wait for market volatility to increase

### "Insufficient balance"
- Need USDC on Arbitrum for spot trades
- Need margin on Hyperliquid for futures
- Minimum: $100 in each venue

### "Transaction failed"
- Gas price too high - bot will retry
- Slippage exceeded - increase slippage tolerance
- Check wallet connection

### "Position not opening"
- Risk limits exceeded
- Max positions reached (2/2)
- Close existing position first

